  "details": "After I registered an account for my wife on your website I tried to register one for my grand daughter.  I got a 409 error, telling me I have to wait a while before creating another account on this computer.  Waited a day.. STILL got it.. Went to another computer.. STILL got it.  Had to do it from my cellphone with the WiFi turned off.  I think you need to shorten the account creation delay by A LOT.. and why do you say \"on this computer\" when it is \"On this IP\".  Also expand the amounts you are allowed to create before the delay.  A typical household is 4 people.",
